      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4 couches LLM SEQUENTIELLES :\n\n1. Territoire\n   DDD / Business Canvas\n   Stakeholders / Acteurs\n\n2. Flux\n   VSM / SIPOC / EventStorming\n   Bounded Contexts\n\n3. Problemes\n   Ishikawa / Pareto\n   TOC / 5 Pourquoi\n\n4. Priorites\n   CPM/PERT / SWOT\n   OKRs / MoSCoW\n\nAsync : status polling\nSQLite : /data/audit.db",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4 couches LLM SEQUENTIELLES :\n\n1. Territoire\n   DDD / Business Canvas\n   Stakeholders / Acteurs\n\n2. Flux\n   VSM / SIPOC / EventStorming\n   Bounded Contexts\n\n3. Problemes\n   Ishikawa / Pareto\n   TOC / 5 Pourquoi\n\n4. Priorites\n   CPM/PERT / SWOT\n   OKRs / MoSCoW\n\nAsync : status polling\nSQLite : /data/audit.db",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
