      "text": "Plan LLM → HTML Bootstrap 5\n\nRegistre briques_app/ :\n  auto-decouverte (*.py)\n  construire(ctx) -> [vue]\n\nVues generees :\n  dashboard, CRUD entites\n  Pareto CA×Temps×Pénibilite\n  Messagerie (Oria SSO)\n  Application proposee\n\nModes :\n  autonome (localStorage)\n  heberge (API Donnees)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Plan LLM → HTML Bootstrap 5\n\nRegistre briques_app/ :\n  auto-decouverte (*.py)\n  construire(ctx) -> [vue]\n\nVues generees :\n  dashboard, CRUD entites\n  Pareto CA×Temps×Pénibilite\n  Messagerie (Oria SSO)\n  Application proposee\n\nModes :\n  autonome (localStorage)\n  heberge (API Donnees)",
